OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry in the evening with clear spells.
OL,7,FThen turning cloudy overnight with
OL,8,Ffreshening winds and patchy rain late
OL,9,Fin the southwest. Breezy near western
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with mostly patchy
OL,13,Flight rain by day, but the rain may
OL,14,Fturn heavier in the evening.
OL,15,FOccasionally strong winds around the
OL,16,Fcoast. Generally drier in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
